_bz4YQ7kNvwHDtJy7&_nc_oc=AdnCznBsJDmKIO5NkAYjNf92S87e3yz3bw01X4xd_phe56nrd4avz2vwxmZmePwMwAs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afsv2ot_oNbSqh8UH517wNJk1_ecMd8EKlaWCHMzFGcXhA&oe=69A17A22"}, {"file_name": "BLUD B.png", "id": "426833337103207", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035405_426833340436540_7316009765902565502_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7K4IY5pZdtQQ7kNvwG24Wzi&_nc_oc=AdkOHkSDuUpNZdn9dN_6WPn3rS8xaUeUHIdTZE0arh0dvFJEyPc5sqeyI83VInhotFk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfspVe9qDIJxWbNetW0s3g60QLlLJ17NcuANn74f4X-16w&oe=69A1AA23"}, {"file_name": "BLUD D.png", "id": "567194512633582", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003249_567194515966915_5134737270553800221_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AxRbZT3QyRUQ7kNvwH1-YOs&_nc_oc=Adn665jRqLHPTY4NqMmLvb9pSHDt9HKaKo2B94sOrdjyZVbGI1seHgAgsBoHc3pBF8Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvPRcdqECsLGM_iCzht8jpFQ46Z6I-qb9ayRUy5ZosDdg&oe=69A18046"}, {"file_name": "BLUD E.png", "id": "512750678316931", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974595_512750684983597_6316622060033192551_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BoUFSjopcHcQ7kNvwFnskNO&_nc_oc=AdnOFig1n7z11glprj-g4X0lpZfV4Sr8l6BjUvvf-VRbC1J9UnXIA0DZCpuZzlr7BP8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsCpDMbA083KF3mz40mgrFsFE_6yt4YVFO_L40EyDcgCg&oe=69A1ABE1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "BLUD trailer cover.png", "id": "1257187508752269", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75230049_1257187512085602_1909194995855667713_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zQ3miWPAHgYQ7kNvwEIJ0eJ&_nc_oc=AdnzmmwY8WsUgIEIWOeUukAefFbQFn-GDkuRWRDRSpijGyfktLyMR_KDBYRZJrLYEEo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftkCY0EUzpZeRaFZ9lay35uicoHPjNGAGpDELzUPLjXog&oe=69A1893B"}, "display_name": "BLUD", "keywords": ["gore", "violence", "guns", "sigma", "blood"], "long_description": "Unleash chaos and hilarity with BLUD, your very own mixed reality rage room! \nTurn your home into a battleground of absurd destruction, where colorful flying unicorns invade your space and only you can stop them.\n\n{1326912111658201}\n\n\"Bro woke up and chose violence\" \ud83e\udd84\n\n\n# Absurd Weapons\nGuns, chainsaws, crayons, and more \u2014 choose your tools of destruction and get creative with how you take down those pesky unicorns.\n\n{1140433681093627}\n\n\n\n# Multiple Game Modes\nWhether you're racing against time, pulling off trick shots, stopping a zombie outbreak, or focusing on one specific target (looking at you, Larry), there's a mode for every kind of chaos-lover.\n\n{544649441872261}\n\n# Endless Humor\nFeaturing Larry, a sarcastic talking unicorn with hundreds of hilarious lines, ready to taunt and entertain you throughout the madness.\n\n{1529351324437567}\n\n# 100% Mixed Reality\nExperience unicorn carnage in your own home as the game seamlessly blends your environment with a magical, blood-splattered battlefield.\n\n{1085416866703270}\n\n# Endless Fun\nEnjoy hours of replayable chaos that's perfect for showing off the power of mixed reality to friends and family.\n\nTransform your home into a wild, magical rage room and let the glitter, poop, and blood fly!\n\nAre you ready to paint your walls with unicorn blood?\n", "short_description": "Unleash chaos and hilarity with BLUD, your very own mixed reality rage room! \nTurn your home into a battleground of absurd destruction, where colorful flying unicorns invade your space and only you can stop them.\n\n\"Bro woke up and chose violence\" \ud83e\udd84"}]}, "developer_name": "No Ragrets Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://noragrets.wixsite.com/noragretsgames/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://noragrets.wixsite.com/noragretsgames/eula", "publisher_name": "No Ragrets Games", "support_website_url": null, "websi